arns extra chances and keeps the run alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum is Life:</strong> A <strong>3-minute timer</strong> governs every level. If you aren't moving forward, you're falling behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Checkpoint Grind:</strong> Unlimited continues keep you in the fight, but a Game Over sends you back to the start of the level and wipes your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Hero, One Run:</strong> Lock in your class at the start. Once the descent begins, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.poster.avif?t=1773893311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.webm?t=1773893311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.mp4?t=1773893311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHAMPION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three mercenaries. Three ways to bleed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f The Knight: The Iron Vanguard</strong> Built for those who prefer to trade blows. Low speed, but high survivability with 4 Health and a reliable Fireball for keeping threats at a distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 The Mage: The Tactical Zoner</strong> A glass cannon with a massive Mana pool. Control the screen with long-range attacks and keep the corruption at bay\u2014just don't let it get close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f The Rogue: The Berserker\u00a0</strong>The fastest class on the island. Use raw speed to bypass traps and unleash a Mana-fueled <strong>Whirlwind Slash</strong> to delete anything in your path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/e60bbfe28297016a8ef8c9b26562a339.avif?t=1773893311\" width=1560 height=881 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>12 ZONES. 30+ ENEMIES. ONE ULTIMATE BOUNTY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the lush Outer Forest to the crushing depths of the Sanctuary, the island is a gauntlet of dripping lava, swinging spikes, and collapsible floors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses:</strong> Every zone culminates in a high-stakes showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Gauntlet:</strong> Learn the patterns of 30+ unique enemy types across 12 handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Your Mastery:</strong> There are no easy modes here: only better scores and faster times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1773893311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1773893311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1773893311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Calibus Creations LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description"